SOAPBOX: Band condx. were clearly better on Saturday. Altho running QRP, a lot of time
SOAPBOX: was spent calling CQ WPX WQ6X WQ6X to offer up the WQ6 prefix.
SOAPBOX: What I love about the WPX GiG is the variety of Truly WEIRD prefixes
SOAPBOX: which make the scene JUST for these events.
SOAPBOX: Read more about this at: http://WQ6X.Blogspot.com
